  "metadata": {
    "roundId": "20260725-opus5-eight-models",
    "title": {
      "zh": "Opus 5 等八模型四项实测",
      "en": "Four hands-on tests across eight AI models"
    },
    "dateRange": "2026-07-25—2026-07-26",
    "taskOrder": ["2d", "3d", "vision", "aesthetic"],
    "scoringNote": {
      "zh": "四项均按 100 分计，只比较成品质量；速度和 Token 单独列，不进入质量分。GLM 5.2 的识图通道不支持图片输入，因此总均分按其完成的三项计算。",
      "en": "Each task is scored out of 100 for output quality only. Time and token usage are reported separately. GLM 5.2 could not receive images through the tested connection, so its average covers the three tasks it completed."
    },
    "methodNote": {
      "zh": "五个本周新模型使用同题、同素材和各自 CLI 的最高可用推理档。游戏与网页遮住模型名后实际试玩并按固定维度评分；识图按预先冻结的答案程序判分。GPT-5.6 Sol、Kimi K3 和 MiniMax M3 的部分成绩沿用上一轮公开记录，产品发布页则由八家本期全部重跑。",
      "en": "The five newly tested models received the same briefs and inputs through their respective CLIs at the highest available reasoning setting. Games and pages were reviewed blind against fixed dimensions; image answers were scored against a frozen key. Some GPT-5.6 Sol, Kimi K3, and MiniMax M3 results come from the prior published round, while all eight product pages were rerun in this round."
    },
    "publicDataNote": {
      "zh": "公开页提供冻结分数、评分拆分、完成时间、Token 记录与网页原作；不公开账号凭证和原始运行日志。",
      "en": "The public Lab includes frozen scores, score breakdowns, completion times, token records, and submitted web builds. Credentials and raw execution logs remain private."
    },
